---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: ""
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{% from "partials/photo-cell.njk" import photoCell %}
{% set m = site.meet %}
{% set s = site.social %}

<section class="hero">
  <img class="hero-logo" src="{{ '/logo.svg' | rel }}" alt="UkeHoot" />
  <p class="hero-tagline">{{ site.tagline }}</p>
  <p class="hero-sub">
    A roomful of strummers, songbooks open, nobody in charge.
    Bring a uke or borrow one, grab a seat, have a hoot.
  </p>

  <p class="marquee" aria-label="When and where we meet">
    <span>★</span> {{ m.day }} <span>·</span> {{ m.time }} <span>·</span> {{ m.venue }} <span>★</span>
  </p>

  <p class="cta-row">
    <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#visit">Come along</a>
    <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#updates">Get updates</a>
  </p>
</section>

<section class="band" id="about">
  <header class="band-head">
    <p class="band-label">What we are</p>
    <h2 class="band-song">&ldquo;Come Together&rdquo;</h2>
  </header>
  <div class="band-body">
    <p>
      <strong>UkeHoot</strong> has been Edinburgh's weekly ukulele singalong since 2012.
      Pop, folk, a bit of rock&rsquo;n&rsquo;roll, and the odd novelty number nobody will
      own up to picking.
    </p>
    <p>
      There&rsquo;s no leader, no committee, no setlist handed down from on high. People
      turn up, someone kicks off a song, everyone piles in. That&rsquo;s the entire
      agenda, and somehow it has outlasted a fistful of venues, a pandemic, and more
      Edinburgh festivals than we can count.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="visit">
  <header class="band-head">
    <p class="band-label">Where &amp; when</p>
    <h2 class="band-song">&ldquo;Anticipation&rdquo;</h2>
  </header>
  <div class="band-body">
    <p class="lead">
      We play every <strong>{{ m.day | lower }}</strong> from <strong>{{ m.time }}</strong>.
    </p>
    <p class="venue-line">
      {{ m.venue }}{% if m.address %}, {{ m.address }}{% endif %}.
      {% if m.mapUrl %}<a href="{{ m.mapUrl }}" rel="external">Find us on the map →</a>{% endif %}
    </p>
    <p class="note">
      Festival season is Edinburgh's silly season and it can shuffle us about, and
      we're starting to pop up at a few spots beyond the city too. Check
      {% if s.facebook %}<a href="{{ s.facebook }}" rel="external">Facebook</a>{% else %}Facebook{% endif %}
      for where to be that week before you set off.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{% if site.gig %}
{% set g = site.gig %}
<section class="band" id="gig">
  <header class="band-head">
    <p class="band-label">Catch us live</p>
    <h2 class="band-song">&ldquo;Saturday Night&rdquo;</h2>
  </header>
  <div class="band-body">
    <p class="lead">
      Once a month we plug in and play out.
    </p>
    <p class="venue-line">
      {{ g.schedule }}, we take over
      {% if g.url %}<a href="{{ g.url }}" rel="external">{{ g.venue }}</a>{% else %}{{ g.venue }}{% endif %}
      from <strong>{{ g.time }}</strong> til the strings give out.
      {% if g.mapUrl %}<a href="{{ g.mapUrl }}" rel="external">Find the bar →</a>{% endif %}
    </p>
    <p>Come watch, sing along, heckle gently.</p>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="band" id="join">
  <header class="band-head">
    <p class="band-label">How to join</p>
    <h2 class="band-song">&ldquo;With a Little Help From My Friends&rdquo;</h2>
  </header>
  <div class="band-body">
    <p>Nothing to sign, no fee, no audition. Just turn up. To get in the loop:</p>
    <ul class="join-list">
      <li>
        <strong>WhatsApp</strong> is where it all happens: who's coming, what we're
        playing, gear envy and the occasional terrible pun.
        {% if s.whatsapp %}<a href="{{ s.whatsapp }}" rel="external">Join the WhatsApp →</a>{% endif %}
      </li>
      <li>
        Brand new to the uke? Now and then a willing volunteer runs a beginners' session.
        No schedule, no charge, just ask on WhatsApp.
      </li>
      <li>
        New and want a flick through first?
        {% if site.songbookUrl %}<a href="{{ site.songbookUrl }}" rel="external">Download the songbook →</a>{% elif s.whatsapp %}Our songbook lives in the WhatsApp community. <a href="{{ s.whatsapp }}" rel="external">Join and it&rsquo;s yours →</a>{% else %}<span class="soon">Songbook — coming soon.</span>{% endif %}
        {% if site.songbookSpotifyUrl %}
        <p class="songbook-listen">
          Fancy a listen before you strum along? The current songbook is a playlist.
          {% include "partials/spotify-link.njk" %}
        </p>
        {% endif %}
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="bring">
  <header class="band-head">
    <p class="band-label">What to bring &amp; how it works</p>
    <h2 class="band-song">&ldquo;Should I Stay or Should I Go&rdquo;</h2>
  </header>
  <div class="band-body">
    <ul class="tick-list">
      <li>A ukulele, if you've got one. If not, we can usually lend you a spare.</li>
      <li>That's it. Songbooks are shared on the night.</li>
      <li>All levels welcome. We play at a friendly, follow-along pace and nobody's marking your chord shapes.</li>
      <li>It all happens in a proper Edinburgh pub, so come for a tune and stay for a pint.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="answer">So, should you stay or should you go? <strong>Stay.</strong></p>
  </div>
</section>

{% if site.featuredVideo %}
<section class="band" id="watch">
  <header class="band-head">
    <p class="band-label">See us in action</p>
    <h2 class="band-song">&ldquo;Video Killed the Radio Star&rdquo;</h2>
  </header>
  <div class="band-body">
    <p>
      Can&rsquo;t make it along just yet? Here&rsquo;s what a roomful of ukuleles
      actually sounds like. Press play, mind the neighbours.
    </p>
    {% youtube site.featuredVideo, "UkeHoot live" %}
    {% if s.youtube %}<p class="more-link"><a href="{{ s.youtube }}" rel="external">More on our YouTube &rarr;</a></p>{% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% if collections.galleryPhotos.length > 0 %}
<section class="band band--photos" id="photos">
  <header class="band-head">
    <p class="band-label">From the sessions</p>
    <h2 class="band-song">&ldquo;Pictures of You&rdquo;</h2>
  </header>
  <div class="band-body">
    <div class="teaser-grid">
      {% for photo in collections.galleryPhotos | limit(8) %}{{ photoCell(photo.postUrl | rel, photo.src | rel, photo.title, "teaser-cell", true) }}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="more-link"><a href="{{ '/gallery/' | rel }}">See the whole gallery →</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="band" id="updates">
  <header class="band-head">
    <p class="band-label">Stay in the loop</p>
    <h2 class="band-song">&ldquo;Hello, Goodbye&rdquo;</h2>
  </header>
  <div class="band-body">
    <p>Venue changes, one-off gigs, festival chaos: it lands on Facebook first, so that's the one to follow. WhatsApp is for the regulars.</p>
    <p class="social-row">
      {% if s.facebook %}<a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ s.facebook }}" rel="external">Facebook</a>{% endif %}
      {% if s.whatsapp %}<a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ s.whatsapp }}" rel="external">WhatsApp</a>{% endif %}
      {% if s.instagram %}<a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ s.instagram }}" rel="external">Instagram</a>{% endif %}
      {% if s.youtube %}<a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ s.youtube }}" rel="external">YouTube</a>{% endif %}
    </p>
    <p class="contact-line">
      Bookings, questions, or just saying hello?
      {% include "partials/email-link.njk" %}
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
